VectorNet: Encoding HD Maps and Agent Trajectories for Trajectory Prediction (Gao et al., 2020)
Method: Uses Graph Neural Networks (GNNs) on spatial vectors for tracking.
Dataset: Argoverse motion forecasting dataset.
Advantages: Operates directly on vector maps without lossy images.
Limitations: Complex pipeline is too heavy for fast edge compute.
Research Gap: Lightweight spatial trajectory models suited for edge nodes.
Possible Improvements: Simplifies input to lightweight $x, y, z$ coordinates for fast edge inference.
